  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 2001.20 “Medical examiner (ME)” means any person authorized pursuant to RSA 611 and RSA 611-A to investigate potential medicolegal cases.\n\nSource. #8937, eff 7-14-07",
